<title>USA: Dove names new CFO.</title>
<headline>Dove names new CFO.</headline>
<dateline>LOS ANGELES 1997-08-11</dateline>
<text>
<p>Dove Entertainment Inc said Monday that acting chief financial officer Neil Topham has been named to the post permanently.</p>
<p>A spokesman was not immediately available for comment.</p>
<p>Dove is a diversified entertainment company primarily engaged in the publication of audio and printed books, the production of television programming and the distribution of television programming and feature films.  </p>
<p>A spokeswoman said later Monday that Topham had been acting chief financial officer for the past four months, succeeding Simon Baker, who left earlier this year.</p>
<p>((-- New York Newsdesk 212-859-1610))</p>
